        "description": "LM386 low-voltage audio power amplifier. Input signals received on IN_POS (non-inverting) and IN_NEG (inverting). Preamp output feeds IN_POS; IN_NEG is referenced to common ground via external resistor/capacitor network. Gain pins GAIN_1/GAIN_2 configure amplifier gain via external resistor (default gain 20 if bypassed). VS power rail connected to VIN_9V. BYPASS pin may be bypassed with capacitor for noise reduction. VOUT drives the 8-ohm speaker load (ground referenced). Configuration intent: gain ~20-200 set via resistor between GAIN_1/GAIN_2.",
